  <!--
    Icon set "Gefaste Linie" (DESIGN 5.1): 24×24 grid, live area 20×20, stroke 2 at 24 px (RhIcon scales it),
    straight lines only at 0°/45°/90°, arcs only for real circles (lens, disc, clock), corners chamfered (2 px, 45°),
    square caps, mitre joins. Filled variants for active states (Filled="True"). Colour = Foreground.
    Keys: "Icon.<Name>". The v0 key names (Icon.Home, Icon.Gamepad …) stay and point at the new drawings.
  -->

